        "aṅga[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]upāṅga[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]astra[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]pārṣada[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]saṅge",
